{"cluster_id": "C-3113", "topic": "read path claim", "target": "architecture/read-path", "member_ids": ["B023-006"], "canonical_claim": "`StorageProxy` inherits `supportsOptimizationToSubcolumns`, so it can report support even when a nested engine such as `IStorageCluster` explicitly opts out.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-21-storageproxy-forwarding-audit.md#L54-L58"]}
